      "body": "1. Put the dataset here:\n\n`data/telco/WA_Fn-UseC_-Telco-Customer-Churn.csv`\n\n2. Restart the notebook kernel and run all cells.\n\n3. Check the new `Recall` for class `Yes`. It should target roughly 80%, usually with lower precision/accuracy.\n\n4. For inference, load both the pipeline and threshold:\n\n```python\nartifact = joblib.load(\"logistic_regression/models/classifier_model_1.joblib\")\nproba = artifact[\"pipeline\"].predict_proba(new_X)[:, 1]\nprediction = np.where(\n    proba >= artifact[\"decision_threshold\"],\n    \"Yes\",\n    \"No\",\n)\n```",
